  {
    "@id": "https://www.ensemblecaprice.com/concert/vivaldi-en-feu-2025-2",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Immerse yourself in a musical journey where Vivaldi’s fiery spirit meets the captivating soul of Eastern European nomadic traditions! Under the inspired direction of Matthias Maute, Ensemble Caprice invites you to an electrifying evening of concertos, cantatas, and folk rhythms. Let yourself be swept away by this bold fusion of baroque elegance and the blazing vitality of folklore, set in the legendary 9th floor of the Eaton Centre. A vibrant and unforgettable musical experience awaits!\n\nProgramAntonio Vivaldi: Sonata La Folia, RV 63Motet In furore iustissimae irae, RV 626Cantata All’ombra di sospetto, RV 678Concerto in C Major for two recorders, two violins, and basso continuo RV533  Anonymous, Nomadic Music – Uhrovska Collection 1730"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/5e586c_f487b3b041ee45bca1df304fab0a68ff~mv2.png/v1/fit/w_2500,h_1330,al_c/5e586c_f487b3b041ee45bca1df304fab0a68ff~mv2.png"
