    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Experience the magic of the holiday season, with excerpts from Handel’s brilliant Messiah and Bach’s grand Christmas Oratorio.\n\nThis year, Ensemble Caprice and Matthias Maute, in collaboration with Festival Classica, present an enchanting program that reimagines one of the most beloved holiday traditions! From Bach’s jubilant Jauchzet, frohlocket to Handel’s iconic Hallelujah, this exceptional concert promises a grand and unique celebration. A captivating musical experience where splendor and emotion come together to illuminate your holiday season like never before.\n\nProgram:Matthias Maute, HallelujahJohann Sebastian Bach, Christmas Oratorio BWV 248, Cantate I Jauchzet, frohlocketGeorge Frideric Handel, Messiah HWV 56, Part I (Nativité)George Frideric Handel, Messiah, HWV 56: Part II: No. 44. Chorus: Hallelujah"
