  {
    "@id": "https://www.ensemblecaprice.com/concert/messie-2025-qc",
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join Ensemble Caprice for their cherished holiday tradition, Handel's iconic Messiah, brought to life in concert at Quebec City's Salle Raoul-Jobin. Revel in the grace and splendor of Handel's melodies, beloved by audiences worldwide for centuries. Experience the magic of this extraordinary Baroque masterpiece anew, presented in collaboration with Ensemble ArtChoral and Festival Classica, under the baton of conductor Matthias Maute.\n\nProgram:\nG.F. Handel, Messiah, HWV 56\nExcerpts for choir, soloists and orchestra"
      }
    ],
